          </h2>
          <p class="source__lead r" style="--d:.1s">
            The brands pulling ahead on Douyin in 2026 are not the ones with
            the biggest tool stack. They are the ones who run a creative
            process worth the name, with AI carrying the volume inside it.
          </p>
          <p class="source__p r" style="--d:.16s">
            We sit between the technical side and the creative side. There are
            directors, retouchers and colorists in the building, and there are
            AI engineers and a LoRA-training pipeline in the same building.
            Every cut carries the discipline of the hero frame, because the
            same people approve it.
          </p>
          <ul class="creds r" style="--d:.22s">
