                <li class="cred">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M2 7.5 5.5 11 12 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                  </svg>
                  {c}
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
          <p class="source__p r" style="--d:.26s">
            Everything runs on private infrastructure. Hosting sits in mainland
            China, Hong Kong, the EU or the US, depending on where your data is
            allowed to live. The LoRA models trained on your brand stay yours,
            and you can take them with you if you ever walk.
          </p>
          <p class="source__p source__p--quiet r" style="--d:.3s">
            Some brands hand us all five lanes. Others hand us one. Both work.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- S6 · PROCESS -->
    <section class="craft" id="craft">
      <div class="shell craft__intro">
        <p class="kicker r"><span class="kicker__tick"></span>How a Douyin campaign runs</p>
        <h2 class="dh r" style="--d:.05s">
          One brief,<br />every <span class="serif">placement</span>.
        </h2>
        <p class="craft__lede r" style="--d:.12s">
          A feed video, a TopView spot, a livestream, an avatar cut: different
